Every clinician should not consider a first-line-opioid-therapy for a subacute-pain.
Every clinician should not consider a routine-opioid-therapy for a subacute-pain.
Every clinician should not consider a first-line-opioid-therapy for a chronic-pain.
Every clinician should not consider a routine-opioid-therapy for a chronic-pain.
If a patient has a subacute-pain then an opioid-therapy should not be first-line for the subacute-pain.
If a patient has a chronic-pain then an opioid-therapy should not be first-line for the chronic-pain.
